.Dd November 21, 2026
.Dt PFCTL 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm pfctl
.Nd pf.conf front-end (administrative-section entry)
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility parses and prints pf.conf rulesets and parses table files.
Its synopsis, the supported syntax, the canonical output form and the exit
codes are documented in
.Xr pfctl 1 .
.Pp
This page exists because the
.Sq pfctl
image profile installs
.Nm
in
.Pa /sbin ,
so the administrative manual section applies to the installed path.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pfctl 1
